{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "The Unexpected (But Not Entirely Surprising) Demise of Jacques du Schnozzle",
    "steam_appid": 3268680,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jacques Du Schnozzle is the worst person in the world. Thankfully though, he\u2019s just been murdered.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this live-action, interactive movie, you\u2019ll join Alana, Tim, and Lorenzo as they embark on a journey to try and figure out who killed Jacques Du Schnozzle. With no witnesses, little evidence, and zero experience in the field of criminal investigation, can this intrepid threesome solve the case or will they fall to the forces of evil?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268680/extras/80c9d6775db687ab05cf0eb6c15a06fa.poster.avif?t=1749575621\" width=660 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268680/extras/80c9d6775db687ab05cf0eb6c15a06fa.webm?t=1749575621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268680/extras/80c9d6775db687ab05cf0eb6c15a06fa.mp4?t=1749575621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starring Ashton Matthews (<i>TripleJump</i>), Ben Potter (<i>also</i> <i>TripleJump</i>), Peter Austin (<i>again,</i> <i>TripleJump</i>), and James Jenkins (<i>Holbeach Primary School\u2019s 1997 Production of Charles Dickens\u2019 A Christmas Caro</i>l)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jaw-dropping stunts and special effects like nothing you\u2019ve ever seen before</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompany Alana, Lorenzo, and Tim as they embark on a dark, mysterious, and potentially supernatural journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices that will alter the course of the story and unlock more than 10 different endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268680/extras/ccf946debdd6f6ace35e6c511c8cdd59.poster.avif?t=1749575621\" width=660 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268680/extras/ccf946debdd6f6ace35e6c511c8cdd59.webm?t=1749575621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268680/extras/ccf946debdd6f6ace35e6c511c8cdd59.mp4?t=1749575621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All Alana ever wanted was to be a celebrity chef, but after booking diva movie star Jacques Du Schnozzle to appear on her cooking show, she begins having regrets. Whilst shooting the latest episode on a closed set, the lights suddenly go out, and when the power comes back, Alana, her producer Lorenzo, and Jacques\u2019 assistant Tim find Jacques brutally murdered. Facing a PR disaster, the plucky trio decide to try and solve the crime themselves. After all, how hard can it be to catch a killer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268680/extras/70ee6427df83897efba289f0e6f9095f.poster.avif?t=1749575621\" width=660 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268680/extras/70ee6427df83897efba289f0e6f9095f.webm?t=1749575621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268680/extras/70ee6427df83897efba289f0e6f9095f.mp4?t=1749575621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game you will be faced with tricky choices. Some options will bring you closer to catching Jacques\u2019 killer, some will spell the end for our band of courageous heroes, and others will take them on a journey they\u2019ll never forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268680/extras/2685f17c1616d40004f2ad23cfbf5e9a.poster.avif?t=1749575621\" width=660 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268680/extras/2685f17c1616d40004f2ad23cfbf5e9a.webm?t=1749575621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268680/extras/2685f17c1616d40004f2ad23cfbf5e9a.mp4?t=1749575621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We here at Team TripleJump love video games, and one night whilst having a little too much to drink and playing through a few of Wales Interactive's Live Action masterpieces, we thought to ourselves: \u201cWhy don\u2019t we make a video game? How hard can it be?\u201d Well, turns out it's really quite hard, but we\u2019ve done it regardless, and we hope you have as much fun playing our love letter to the FMV genre as we had creating it!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jacques Du Schnozzle is the worst person in the world. Thankfully though, he\u2019s just been murdered.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this live-action, interactive movie, you\u2019ll join Alana, Tim, and Lorenzo as they embark on a journey to try and figure out who killed Jacques Du Schnozzle. With no witnesses, little evidence, and zero experience in the field of criminal investigation, can this intrepid threesome solve the case or will they fall to the forces of evil?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268680/extras/80c9d6775db687ab05cf0eb6c15a06fa.poster.avif?t=1749575621\" width=660 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268680/extras/80c9d6775db687ab05cf0eb6c15a06fa.webm?t=1749575621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268680/extras/80c9d6775db687ab05cf0eb6c15a06fa.mp4?t=1749575621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starring Ashton Matthews (<i>TripleJump</i>), Ben Potter (<i>also</i> <i>TripleJump</i>), Peter Austin (<i>again,</i> <i>TripleJump</i>), and James Jenkins (<i>Holbeach Primary School\u2019s 1997 Production of Charles Dickens\u2019 A Christmas Caro</i>l)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jaw-dropping stunts and special effects like nothing you\u2019ve ever seen before</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompany Alana, Lorenzo, and Tim as they embark on a dark, mysterious, and potentially supernatural journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make choices that will alter the course of the story and unlock more than 10 different endings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268680/extras/ccf946debdd6f6ace35e6c511c8cdd59.poster.avif?t=1749575621\" width=660 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268680/extras/ccf946debdd6f6ace35e6c511c8cdd59.webm?t=1749575621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268680/extras/ccf946debdd6f6ace35e6c511c8cdd59.mp4?t=1749575621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All Alana ever wanted was to be a celebrity chef, but after booking diva movie star Jacques Du Schnozzle to appear on her cooking show, she begins having regrets. Whilst shooting the latest episode on a closed set, the lights suddenly go out, and when the power comes back, Alana, her producer Lorenzo, and Jacques\u2019 assistant Tim find Jacques brutally murdered. Facing a PR disaster, the plucky trio decide to try and solve the crime themselves. After all, how hard can it be to catch a killer?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268680/extras/70ee6427df83897efba289f0e6f9095f.poster.avif?t=1749575621\" width=660 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268680/extras/70ee6427df83897efba289f0e6f9095f.webm?t=1749575621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268680/extras/70ee6427df83897efba289f0e6f9095f.mp4?t=1749575621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the game you will be faced with tricky choices. Some options will bring you closer to catching Jacques\u2019 killer, some will spell the end for our band of courageous heroes, and others will take them on a journey they\u2019ll never forget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268680/extras/2685f17c1616d40004f2ad23cfbf5e9a.poster.avif?t=1749575621\" width=660 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268680/extras/2685f17c1616d40004f2ad23cfbf5e9a.webm?t=1749575621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3268680/extras/2685f17c1616d40004f2ad23cfbf5e9a.mp4?t=1749575621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We here at Team TripleJump love video games, and one night whilst having a little too much to drink and playing through a few of Wales Interactive's Live Action masterpieces, we thought to ourselves: \u201cWhy don\u2019t we make a video game? How hard can it be?\u201d Well, turns out it's really quite hard, but we\u2019ve done it regardless, and we hope you have as much fun playing our love letter to the FMV genre as we had creating it!</p>",
